Copyright holder: the SudoVDA README names no copyright holder for its own
changes (it only says to consult Microsoft for the sample's license); the
Microsoft copyright line above is the sample's standard header.

Note: the SudoVDA repository does not ship a separate LICENSE file. The terms
above come from its README and from the Microsoft sample it is derived from.

nefconc.exe (bundled next to the driver) is part of nefarius/nefcon
(https://github.com/nefarius/nefcon), whose license is reproduced below.

